# Scratch directory for the development harness that built this repository.
# It was previously hidden only by an UNTRACKED `.superpowers/sdd/.gitignore`
# containing `*` -- so nothing in version control actually prevented it from
# shipping, and a fresh clone or a `git clean` would have made it visible again.
# A rule that must hold has to be tracked.
.superpowers/
